Package: AQALY
Title: Compute Animal Quality-Adjusted Life Year (AQALY) Scores
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Romain", "", , "your.email@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes Animal Quality-Adjusted Life Year (AQALY) scores and
    their standard errors from a four-digit welfare state code, using
    parameter estimates from a mixed logit model fitted on stated
    preference data. Standard errors are obtained via the delta method.
